scenario the node walks off while the wrist stays at the desk
describe docs/adr/0013-node-motion.md §3, replayed. Every observation here comes
describe from a node's receiver, and every one of them is correct. So is the
describe wrist's accelerometer. They are simply about two different objects: the
describe wearer is at a desk, and the node is in a bag going down a corridor.
describe
describe A detector that compares them anyway reports that something is lying,
describe on the only position source a Waveshare board has. The last two steps
describe are the control — the same walk judged against the node's OWN stillness
describe is evidence, so this fixture cannot be satisfied by a detector that was
describe merely switched off.

at 0
  source node
  fix 3d
  pos 5000000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion still watch
  expect trust trusted

# About 190 m in three minutes: a walk, not a jump, and far past the 50 m
# jump-while-still threshold. The wrist has not moved a centimetre and has
# nothing to say about it.
at 180000
  source node
  fix 3d
  pos 5018000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion still watch
  expect trust trusted
  expect no-reason motion-disagreement
  expect no-reason position-jump
  expect no-reason implausible-speed

# A wrist in motion must not switch the detector off for the node either. The
# node has not moved since the step above, and neither has its position, so
# there is still nothing to report — this step exists to show the walking wrist
# changing nothing rather than clearing something.
at 240000
  source node
  fix 3d
  pos 5018000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion moving watch
  expect trust trusted
  expect no-reason motion-disagreement

# The control. Same node, same kind of walk, judged against the node's own
# accelerometer this time — one body, so the comparison means something, and it
# is a disagreement.
at 420000
  source node
  fix 3d
  pos 5036000 10000000
  alt 42000
  acc 3500
  sats 11 14
  hdop 90
  jam none
  spoof none
  motion still node
  expect trust degraded
  expect reason motion-disagreement
  expect no-reason position-jump
  expect no-reason implausible-speed
